OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers receive meningitis B jabs
OL,4,
OL,5,FReading University students have been
OL,6,Fgetting MenB vaccinations during
OL,7,FFreshers' Week.
OL,9,FNHS England commissioned several
OL,10,Fcommunity pharmacies to run on-campus
OL,11,Ffree vaccination clinics.
OL,13,FPaddy Woodman, director of student
OL,14,Fservices at the university, said: "We
OL,15,Fwanted to make it as easy as possible
OL,16,Ffor people to get the vaccinations that
OL,17,Fthey were entitled to, and that they
OL,18,Fshould have, and that would help
OL,19,Feverybody in the university."
